        "original_id": "b195bcc9-85d0-5bb8-b688-ca9de66dbd53",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Moominpappa at Sea, The Old Man and the Sea\n- People: Ernest Hemingway\n- Places: Bimini, Bahamas\n- Topics: literary references, titles, translation, publication\n\nFacts:\n- In 1951, Ernest Hemingway wrote The Old Man and the Sea in Bimini, Bahamas.\n- In 1952, Ernest Hemingway's The Old Man and the Sea was published.\n- The original title of Moominpappa at Sea is a loose reference to Ernest Hemingway's The Old Man and the Sea.\n- The translation of Moominpappa at Sea does not reflect that reference in its title.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
